249
01:25:31.170 --> 01:25:33.170
That is mythology.

250
01:25:33.170 --> 01:25:41.170
The creator of heaven and earth, the only true God, creator of heaven and earth, is not created, he is Creator.

251
01:25:41.170 --> 01:25:49.170
He stands above everything, he made time, so he stands above time, he has nothing to do with time itself.

252
01:25:49.170 --> 01:26:00.170
So the timeline you are in and the question you ask, when did God come into being, is a timeline question he does not participate in, because he exists outside of time.

253
01:26:01.170 --> 01:26:06.170
So then you ask yourself, how old is God then? That is a wrong question.

254
01:26:06.170 --> 01:26:09.170
So if you say, God is very old, that is a wrong question.

255
01:26:09.170 --> 01:26:10.170
God is.

256
01:26:10.170 --> 01:26:14.170
